WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.206
The family was at an amusement park.

2
00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:15.695
"Look at all the rides!" said Harry.

3
00:00:15.696 --> 00:00:21.076
He saw a roller coaster far away.

4
00:00:21.077 --> 00:00:24.161
Its cars went up and down the track.

5
00:00:24.162 --> 00:00:27.838
It looked like lots of fun.

6
00:00:27.839 --> 00:00:31.959
"Let's go on that roller coaster!" said Harry.

7
00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:34.492
"Great idea!" said Dad.

8
00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:40.752
The family walked toward the roller coaster.

9
00:00:40.753 --> 00:00:44.647
But Oliver saw a merry-go-round.

10
00:00:44.648 --> 00:00:48.182
"I want to go on that!" said Oliver.

11
00:00:48.183 --> 00:00:53.001
"Me too," said Emmy.

12
00:00:53.002 --> 00:01:01.526
"I love merry-go-rounds," said Mom.

13
00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:04.525
Everyone rode the merry-go-round.

14
00:01:04.526 --> 00:01:07.571
Harry sat on a horse.

15
00:01:07.572 --> 00:01:11.238
"This is a baby ride," he thought.

16
00:01:11.239 --> 00:01:16.571
"The roller coaster will be more fun."

17
00:01:16.572 --> 00:01:21.158
The family walked some more.

18
00:01:21.159 --> 00:01:29.562
The roller coaster looked bigger now.

19
00:01:29.563 --> 00:01:33.203
"Oh, a Ferris wheel!" said Emmy.

20
00:01:33.204 --> 00:01:44.025
"Let's go on it!" said Aunt Judy.

21
00:01:44.026 --> 00:01:51.099
Everyone got on the Ferris wheel.

22
00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:56.274
It went up very high.

23
00:01:56.275 --> 00:02:00.061
Harry yawned.

24
00:02:00.062 --> 00:02:04.323
"This Ferris wheel is so slow," Harry thought.

25
00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:07.401
"The roller coaster will be much faster."

26
00:02:07.402 --> 00:02:11.043
The family walked some more.

27
00:02:11.044 --> 00:02:17.318
Finally they got to the roller coaster.

28
00:02:17.319 --> 00:02:20.651
Harry looked up and gulped.

29
00:02:20.652 --> 00:02:23.994
The roller coaster looked really scary now.

30
00:02:23.995 --> 00:02:26.603
The cars flew down the track.

31
00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:31.750
The riders screamed.

32
00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:35.624
"Harry, where are you going?" called Dad.

33
00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:45.739
"Back to the merry-go-round!" yelled Harry.

